{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a8b1f3c4-1111-2222-3333-444444444444",
		"name": "Restaurant Phase 3 - End-to-End Tests",
		"description": "End-to-end test collection for the Phase 3 challenge.\n\nServices: auth-service, order-service, payment-service, procpag (external), Kafka.\n\nMain flow:\n1. Register a client (auth-service)\n2. Login -> token saved into {{token}}\n3. Browse the menu\n4. Create an order -> orderId saved into {{order_id}}\n5. Confirm the order -> event 'pedido.criado' published to Kafka\n6. payment-service consumes, calls procpag (with Resilience4j) and publishes 'pagamento.aprovado'\n7. order-service consumes 'pagamento.aprovado' and updates status to PAID\n8. GET order -> status is PAID\n\nMonitoring (payment-service Actuator):\n- /actuator/health\n- /actuator/circuitbreakers (Resilience4j state)\n- /actuator/retries (Resilience4j metrics)\n\nRequires: docker compose up.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "0. Health",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "GET order-service health",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
